<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Made it to semifinals again.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: You're getting consistent. That's more important than getting lucky. Today might test you—I heard that tall boy from the church lane is playing.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: The one who bowls fast?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Confident">>
Ramu: Fast but straight. You've faced worse at dawn practice when your eyes were still sleepy.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Should we do anything special?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Relaxed">>
Ramu: No. Special is for special days. Today is Saturday with stumps.

